//     stage ggx_prefilter: gpu pmrem_ggx_vndf(cubemap_size) after equirect_to_cubemap residency device transfer none
//     stage irradiance_convolution: gpu pmrem_irradiance(cubemap_size) after ggx_prefilter residency device transfer device_to_host
